> [!IMPORTANT]
> This repository has moved into the Facet monorepo and is no longer the active
> JSON Schema implementation.

Use [`facet-json-schema`](https://crates.io/crates/facet-json-schema) from
[`facet-rs/facet`](https://github.com/facet-rs/facet/tree/main/facet-json-schema)
instead.

The replacement crate has a slightly different package name:

- old crate: `facet-jsonschema`
- new crate: `facet-json-schema`
- Rust module path: `facet_json_schema`

After this redirect lands, this repository will be archived.
